      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 3.69,
          "en": "Now, when working with Flutter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.69,
          "end": 6.33,
          "en": "you will create custom widgets all the time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.33,
          "end": 9.36,
          "en": "so it's important that you're able to do this on your own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.36,
          "end": 12.57,
          "en": "Hence, here's your opportunity to practice this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.57,
          "end": 16.17,
          "en": "I want you to create a separate new widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.17,
          "end": 18.33,
          "en": "for this text part here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.33,
          "end": 21.42,
          "en": "This should be outsourced into a separate widget,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.42,
          "end": 25.11,
          "en": "which you could, for example, name StyledText,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.11,
          "end": 27.18,
          "en": "which you then use in this widget here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.18,
          "end": 29.55,
          "en": "in the GradientContainer again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.55,
          "end": 33.06,
          "en": "Create that custom widget for this styled Text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.06,
          "end": 34.92,
          "en": "as explained in the last lectures",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.92,
          "end": 36.27,
          "en": "and after a short pause,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.27,
          "end": 38.28,
          "en": "which I give you to pause this video",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.28,
          "end": 40.02,
          "en": "and try this on your own,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 40.02,
          "end": 42.903,
          "en": "we'll outsource this into a custom widget together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.44,
          "end": 49.56,
          "en": "Did you succeed? Let's now do this together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.56,
          "end": 51.69,
          "en": "For that, I'll first of all create a new file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.69,
          "end": 54.48,
          "en": "because you learned that you should put your own widgets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.48,
          "end": 57.03,
          "en": "into separate files in that lib folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.03,
          "end": 60.12,
          "en": "And I'll name it styled_text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.12,
          "end": 63.84,
          "en": "because I will add a StyledText widget in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.84,
          "end": 67.26,
          "en": "styled_text.dart it is, therefore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 67.26,
          "end": 69.6,
          "en": "And then, in there, we create a class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.6,
          "end": 71.82,
          "en": "and I'll name it StyledText.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 71.82,
          "end": 72.75,
          "en": "The name is up to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 72.75,
          "end": 74.49,
          "en": "but it should follow these conventions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 74.49,
          "end": 75.69,
          "en": "about which you learned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
